{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0924D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"再次潜入苏联后，等待The Boss的，是那个人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"就是那个拉拢她安插的潜伏特工、不断向美国传递假情报的男人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"他曾是The Boss过去的战友，也是她孩子的父亲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没错，就是那个被称为The Sorrow的男人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"就连他也不知道，那个潜伏特工是The Boss派进去的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不，更准确地说，是苏联一方的“贤者们”故意没有告诉他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"他们要让曾经相爱的两个人互相战斗，直到其中一人杀死另一人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"她曾对我说：“一个活，一个死——这就是苏联一方‘贤者们’对我的报复。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"如果两个人都活下来，下一个遭到报复的就会是他们的孩子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"他们已经别无选择。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"The Boss向<R=　他　,THE SORROW>开了枪。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　他　,THE SORROW>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"而他也主动接受了这一切……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"从苏联回到<R=祖国,AMERICA>后，她已经没有任何容身之处。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=祖国,AMERICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"为祖国奉献一切，却因此被当作亡者……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"仅仅因为执政者换了人，她就被蛮不讲理地推上去承担责任。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"换作是我，恐怕无论如何都承受不了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"就在这时，SAS同期的Major Zero向她伸出了手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"这就是FOX的开始。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"至于她后来接到的任务……抱歉，这件事你应该比任何人都更深有体会。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"Alan Shepard完成弹道飞行20天后，Kennedy总统宣布要把人类送上月球。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"如果没有The Boss获得的情报，美国的太空开发一定会严重落后。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"人类甚至可能永远也无法登上月球。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"可是，那项任务侵蚀了她的身体，夺走了她的荣誉，也让她失去了所爱之人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"这段际遇若只用“离奇”来形容，实在太过悲伤……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"苏联也不断积累载人航天成果，到了1963年，Tereshkova成为世界首位女性宇航员。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"据说，他们甚至参考了被埋入黑暗的NASA“Original Lady”计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"这就是The Boss与你分开之后所完成的全部任务。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"Snake，你也许会这么说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"“如果她把我当作特工来用，我绝对不会背叛她……”对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"可我想，The Boss只是不愿把你卷进来。她大概早已有了某种预感。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"这项任务需要借助“贤者们”的网络。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"既然要使用那个网络，无论事情最后走向哪一边，都必须付出某种代价……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"我想，她比任何人都明白这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"所以，请不要再为此后悔。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"The Boss把这张照片托付给我时说，要不要交给你，由我来决定。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"我想，她自己一定也很犹豫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"因为她知道，你一定会责怪自己。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"至于The Boss为什么一直留着这张照片，我也不知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"是为了不忘记自己被抹去存在的怨恨吗？不，她不是那样的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"我想，她真正想传达的一定是这些。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"她作为“活着的亡者”被抹去了存在，但至少希望你一个人知道真相。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"Snake，我想你已经明白了。我偏偏在十年后才把一直没能交给你的照片送来，并不是偶然。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"因为我听说，你做出了某个决定……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"当然，你和The Boss是不同的人。我也没有打算让你推翻自己的决定。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"我只是……希望你知道她看到了什么、感受到了什么。仅此而已……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"所以，把这一切刻在心里。不要忘记她走过的道路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"因为在这个世界上，知道她真相的人，只剩下我和你……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"Boss……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":13,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"可是，即便如此，我还是……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""}]}